{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_decisiones_11_pronostico", "label": "Decisi\u00f3n 11 \u2014 A3 Pron\u00f3stico (Fase 5)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/decisiones/11-pronostico.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": "Brandon Uriel Garc\u00eda S\u00e1nchez", "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_decisiones_11_pronostico_medidas_mas_norte", "label": "Decisi\u00f3n 1: Medidas + norte (series a pronosticar)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/decisiones/11-pronostico.md", "source_location": "L13", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": "Brandon Uriel Garc\u00eda S\u00e1nchez", "contributor": null, "rationale": "El sur no tiene ocupaci\u00f3n hotelera oficial 2025-2026; se pronostican solo series medidas que llegan a 2026 (INAH Oxtankah, INAH Ruta, cruces desde Belice, ocupaci\u00f3n Canc\u00fan como referencia). Descartado: solo INAH (Chetumal sin serie) y estimar ocupaci\u00f3n del sur _est (contradice Fase 3, solo 36 meses)."}, {"id": "docs_decisiones_11_pronostico_hueco_forma_del_anio", "label": "Decisi\u00f3n 2: Hueco + forma del a\u00f1o (meses que no entrenan)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/decisiones/11-pronostico.md", "source_location": "L36", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": "Brandon Uriel Garc\u00eda S\u00e1nchez", "contributor": null, "rationale": "Un mes cerrado no es cero demanda; meses de cierre, parciales y pandemia se marcan y no entrenan pero se conserva el valor. La forma del a\u00f1o sale de todos los a\u00f1os abiertos y el nivel de los meses posteriores a la reapertura. Descartado: solo desde reapertura (19 meses < 24) y ceros como dato real."}, {"id": "docs_decisiones_11_pronostico_pandemia_belice", "label": "Fin de pandemia Belice jun-2022 (PANDEMIA_BELICE)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/decisiones/11-pronostico.md", "source_location": "L101", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": "Brandon Uriel Garc\u00eda S\u00e1nchez", "contributor": null, "rationale": "Mar-jun 2022 eran recuperaci\u00f3n (65-82 % de 2019), no temporada; STL los confund\u00eda (correlaci\u00f3n 0.446). Con el corte en jun-2022 la correlaci\u00f3n sube a 0.847 y Belice entrena 62 meses."}, {"id": "docs_decisiones_11_pronostico_descomposicion_multiplicativa", "label": "Descomposici\u00f3n cl\u00e1sica multiplicativa (forma del a\u00f1o)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/decisiones/11-pronostico.md", "source_location": "L84", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": "Brandon Uriel Garc\u00eda S\u00e1nchez", "contributor": null, "rationale": "STL necesita serie continua y tirar\u00eda los a\u00f1os posteriores a los huecos; la cl\u00e1sica sobre a\u00f1os completos usa todos los a\u00f1os abiertos. Multiplicativa porque la temporada escala con el nivel. STL queda como segunda opini\u00f3n."}, {"id": "docs_decisiones_11_pronostico_stl", "label": "STL (segunda opini\u00f3n)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/decisiones/11-pronostico.md", "source_location": "L86", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_decisiones_11_pronostico_origen_movil", "label": "Origen m\u00f3vil (backtest de 12 meses)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/decisiones/11-pronostico.md", "source_location": "L125", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_decisiones_11_pronostico_holt_winters_forma_fija", "label": "Holt-Winters con forma del a\u00f1o fija", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/decisiones/11-pronostico.md", "source_location": "L137", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Holt-Winters cl\u00e1sico necesita 24 meses seguidos y desde reaperturas solo hay 20 (Bah\u00eda) y 17 (Ruta); la temporada sale de la pieza 2 y el modelo solo sigue el nivel. Variante sin tendencia agregada porque la tendencia se disparaba (\u2212240 visitantes en may-2025)."}, {"id": "docs_decisiones_11_pronostico_regresion_con_clima", "label": "Regresi\u00f3n con clima (modelo elegido en Bah\u00eda, Ruta y Belice)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/decisiones/11-pronostico.md", "source_location": "L134", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_decisiones_11_pronostico_linea_base", "label": "L\u00ednea base: mismo mes del a\u00f1o anterior (elegida en Canc\u00fan)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/decisiones/11-pronostico.md", "source_location": "L132", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_decisiones_11_pronostico_gradient_boosting_rezagos", "label": "Gradient Boosting con rezagos", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/decisiones/11-pronostico.md", "source_location": "L135", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_decisiones_11_pronostico_menor_error_rango_80", "label": "Decisi\u00f3n: Menor error con rango \u2265 80 %", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/decisiones/11-pronostico.md", "source_location": "L143", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": "Brandon Uriel Garc\u00eda S\u00e1nchez", "contributor": null, "rationale": "Por serie se elige el modelo de menor error entre los que tienen rango del 90 % con cobertura real \u2265 80 %. Descartado: menor error sin importar rango (HW sin tendencia en Ruta cubre solo 72 %) y un solo modelo para todo (en Canc\u00fan la regresi\u00f3n comete 58 % m\u00e1s error)."}, {"id": "docs_decisiones_11_pronostico_rango_conformal_90", "label": "Rango conformal del 90 % y cobertura real", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/decisiones/11-pronostico.md", "source_location": "L121", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_decisiones_11_pronostico_poisson_tormentas", "label": "Poisson de tormentas (31 eventos; 40.3 % al menos una al a\u00f1o)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/decisiones/11-pronostico.md", "source_location": "L183", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_decisiones_11_pronostico_supuesto_con_barrido", "label": "Decisi\u00f3n: tormentas como supuesto con barrido (0/25/50 %)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/decisiones/11-pronostico.md", "source_location": "L183", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": "Brandon Uriel Garc\u00eda S\u00e1nchez", "contributor": null, "rationale": "Solo 3 meses con tormenta entre los que entrenan (Earl 2016, Franklin 2017, Lisa 2022); el efecto en visitantes no se puede estimar, as\u00ed que se prueba como supuesto. Descartado: solo mostrar la probabilidad."}, {"id": "docs_decisiones_11_pronostico_monte_carlo_escenarios", "label": "Monte Carlo: escenarios malo / probable / bueno (10,000 futuros)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/decisiones/11-pronostico.md", "source_location": "L200", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_decisiones_11_pronostico_capacidad_probada", "label": "Capacidad probada (mes m\u00e1s alto ya recibido)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/decisiones/11-pronostico.md", "source_location": "L192", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": "Brandon Uriel Garc\u00eda S\u00e1nchez", "contributor": null, "rationale": "Mismo criterio que la selecci\u00f3n de regiones: Ruta 10,465, Bah\u00eda 1,639, Belice 65,792. Descartado: cuartos de hotel (los pron\u00f3sticos son visitantes, no noches) y dejarlo para la Fase 6."}, {"id": "docs_decisiones_11_pronostico_campana_en_fase6", "label": "Decisi\u00f3n: efecto de campa\u00f1a se ve en la Fase 6", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/decisiones/11-pronostico.md", "source_location": "L188", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": "Brandon Uriel Garc\u00eda S\u00e1nchez", "contributor": null, "rationale": "Los escenarios son lo que pasar\u00eda de todos modos; meter un efecto supuesto (+5 %, +10 %) mezclar\u00eda un pron\u00f3stico medido con un n\u00famero sin fuente."}, {"id": "docs_decisiones_11_pronostico_sensibilidad", "label": "Sensibilidad: lluvia y tipo de cambio", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/decisiones/11-pronostico.md", "source_location": "L215", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "backend_torre_pronostico_series", "label": "series.py", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/decisiones/11-pronostico.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "backend_torre_pronostico_forma", "label": "forma.py", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/decisiones/11-pronostico.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "backend_torre_pronostico_modelos", "label": "modelos.py", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/decisiones/11-pronostico.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "backend_torre_pronostico_intervalos", "label": "intervalos.py", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/decisiones/11-pronostico.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "backend_torre_pronostico_seleccion", "label": "seleccion.py", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/decisiones/11-pronostico.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "backend_torre_pronostico_escenarios", "label": "escenarios.py", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/decisiones/11-pronostico.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "tests_test_pronostico", "label": "test_pronostico.py", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/decisiones/11-pronostico.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_decisiones_10_silver_fase5", "label": "Decisi\u00f3n 10 \u2014 Silver Fase 5", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/decisiones/11-pronostico.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_metodologia_ecuaciones", "label": "ECUACIONES.md", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/decisiones/11-pronostico.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_decisiones_11_pronostico", "target": "docs_decisiones_11_pronostico_medidas_mas_norte", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/decisiones/11-pronostico.md", "source_location": "L13", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_decisiones_11_pronostico", "target": "docs_decisiones_11_pronostico_hueco_forma_del_anio", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/decisiones/11-pronostico.md", "source_location": "L36", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_decisiones_11_pronostico_hueco_forma_del_anio", "target": "backend_torre_pronostico_series", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/decisiones/11-pronostico.md", "source_location": "L46", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_decisiones_11_pronostico_pandemia_belice", "target": "backend_torre_pronostico_series", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/decisiones/11-pronostico.md", "source_location": "L59", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_decisiones_11_pronostico_pandemia_belice", "target": "docs_decisiones_11_pronostico_stl", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTR